[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/shoulder-trauma-fractures-and-dislocations/).

Compare injuries involving clavicle, scapula, proximal humerus, and the glenohumeral, AC, and SC relationships. A suspected acute injury requires assessment rather than attempts to reproduce a classification or reduce a joint from this reading.

